  "id": "B-dealer",
  "title": "Journey B1, current state: a dealer files an initial mandatory adverse event report",
  "persona": "P3",
  "task": "A regulatory executive at a licensed importer has all facts of a serious-deterioration event at hand and files the initial report using HSA's Word form (FORM-MDC-ADE-003) by email.",
  "assumptions": [
    "All information is already gathered; looking up IMDRF codes, GMDN terms, UDI and 3-year frequency data is NOT modelled, so this is a lower bound on time on task.",
    "Typed lengths per field are assumptions for a typical initial report (see 'chars'); the description is 600 characters (about 100 words). Sensitivity uses 300 and 1,200.",
    "Each text field: M (recall/decide) + P + B B (click into the field) + H (to keyboard) + K x chars + H (back to mouse).",
    "Checkbox or drop-down: M + P + B B (drop-downs add P + B B for the choice).",
    "Opening Word and the mail client is a 0 s system response because it was not measured.",
    "Fields the form says only exist after the first report (HSA Adverse Event Reference No.) are skipped; fields not applicable are typed as 'NA'."
  ],
  "navigation": [
    { "action": "Open 'Report adverse events'", "ops": "R:S23", "read": ["S23"] },
